# i18n Message Discipline

- Do not hardcode user-facing strings in localized UI when translation keys should be used.
- Add new keys to `messages/en.json` first, then mirror keys in `messages/tr.json` and `messages/ar.json`.
- Keep key names stable and hierarchical; avoid churn/renames without clear need.
- When adding locale-dependent routes or links, follow established `i18n/routing.ts` patterns.
- Avoid editing generated declaration files unless intentionally regenerated as part of the change.
- For partial translations, use explicit placeholders and note follow-up translation work.
